<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #777; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 10px; }
    a { color: #0066cc; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <p>Hi {{firstName}},</p>

    <p>I understand you have a busy schedule — just sending one final note to see if you might be open to connecting.</p>

    <p>If the timing isn't right, no worries at all. If you ever have interest in collaborating down the line, please feel free to reach out.</p>

    <p>Thank you for your time,<br>{{senderName}}</p>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>If you'd prefer not to receive further emails, <a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}">click here to unsubscribe</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
